The insurance clause
--------------------
It fired, and it was honoured. studio/acta/2026-09-17-kickoff.md legitimately
cites ../README.md, repo-root evidence that path.escapes.officina would
otherwise block. Builder-b did not edit that acta to make its own rule go
green; both D-008 rules landed at advise and studio/petitiones/P-004.md went
to the Patron with the firing site named. That is the clause working as
decreed, and it is the correct reading of it. The promotion of D-008 to
